WEBVTT

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:11.130
Yes, I'm fine.

00:00:11.130 --> 00:00:12.470
I'm eating properly.

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.860
No, you don't have to.

00:00:15.860 --> 00:00:17.200
I bet you're too busy for that anyway.

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:20.650
Yeah, I thought so.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:22.360
You're too far.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:31.160
Snow?

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:34.680
No, of course it's not snowing here.

00:00:42.190 --> 00:00:44.600
Okay, bye then.

00:02:39.680 --> 00:02:41.430
In first place!

00:02:42.380 --> 00:02:43.960
That didn't take you guys very long.

00:02:43.960 --> 00:02:45.300
But of course!

00:02:45.300 --> 00:02:46.450
You're the second ones here, though.

00:02:46.450 --> 00:02:47.940
What? No way!

00:02:49.540 --> 00:02:50.510
Who was it?

00:02:50.510 --> 00:02:53.780
Who could've possibly beaten us here?

00:02:53.780 --> 00:02:54.980
Let's see...

00:02:54.980 --> 00:02:56.140
Mizusaka's team.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:02:57.570
Oh, your twin brother.

00:03:02.710 --> 00:03:04.040
Quick, Sensei!

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.270
I need that stamp!

00:03:05.270 --> 00:03:06.870
Our team needs to make progress too!

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:09.950
There's four members in your team, isn't there?

00:03:09.950 --> 00:03:11.180
Let's wait for the rest.

00:03:11.180 --> 00:03:12.860
What...

00:03:20.570 --> 00:03:23.720
Koharu! You're too slow!

00:03:28.090 --> 00:03:30.220
There's no need to hurry...

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:32.500
Of course there is! This is war!

00:03:32.500 --> 00:03:33.660
We have to win!

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:38.220
Orienteering is a little bit different from war...

00:03:38.220 --> 00:03:40.750
Don't take orienteering lightly!

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.170
Speaking of which,
where are the other two?

00:03:43.170 --> 00:03:44.740
Nonoka's...

00:03:45.600 --> 00:03:47.450
What are you doing back there?!

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.970
I'm waiting for Togawa-san to catch up!

00:03:50.490 --> 00:03:52.010
C'mon guys!

00:03:52.800 --> 00:03:55.530
Don't you want to win?

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:58.720
As long as we all have fun, it'll be okay.

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:00.670
Nonoka!

00:04:00.670 --> 00:04:02.040
You're our group's leader!

00:04:02.040 --> 00:04:03.840
Get Shione over here!

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:06.690
This is stupid.

00:04:15.210 --> 00:04:17.340
Sweet! That's the third one down.

00:04:17.340 --> 00:04:19.670
Um, the next one is...

00:04:19.670 --> 00:04:21.500
Oh, I know where this is.

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.770
This is behind the hotel near my house.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:24.870
Yes, that's right!

00:04:24.870 --> 00:04:28.950
I think our shop is one of the checkpoints, too.

00:04:28.950 --> 00:04:32.290
My parents were talking about it with the teachers the other day.

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.100
Um...

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:35.670
Okay! Time to get going!

00:04:36.350 --> 00:04:40.350
Yuzuki, you're going to wear yourself out at this rate.

00:04:41.290 --> 00:04:43.760
Aren't we cheating a little here?

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:47.170
It's just a home-field advantage!

00:04:47.170 --> 00:04:51.260
We've had to share our hometown with that stupid Disc for ages!

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.200
We deserve to have a slight lead!

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:55.880
"Deserve...?"

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.140
And besides,

00:05:00.050 --> 00:05:02.790
their group has the same advantage!

00:05:02.790 --> 00:05:04.410
What are you talking about?

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:06.730
We're not gonna lose to you, got it?!

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.030
Is she up to no good again?

00:05:11.380 --> 00:05:14.660
Sorry, I'm not supposed to fraternize with the enemy. Excuse me.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.280
Excuse us.

00:05:18.560 --> 00:05:21.790
Hey, aren't you guys forgetting about this checkpoint?

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:29.470
We were going to leave that one for last, okay?!

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:41.360
Target in sight!

00:05:42.100 --> 00:05:44.360
Lemme go stamp us off!

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:50.470
I <i>am</i> the leader, right?

00:05:50.470 --> 00:05:52.520
Don't let that bother you.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:56.680
It's important for a leader to take advantage of an eager volunteer.

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.210
Is that so?

00:06:00.570 --> 00:06:02.110
Thanks, Koharu.

00:06:05.550 --> 00:06:08.110
Maybe I'm imagining things...

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.260
Nope. She's definitely avoiding me.

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:14.370
Did something happen between you and Shione?

00:06:14.370 --> 00:06:17.520
Nothing comes to mind...

00:06:18.090 --> 00:06:20.720
C'mon guys, quit being so slow!

00:06:20.720 --> 00:06:22.400
Let's keep moving!

00:06:22.980 --> 00:06:25.310
We gotta hurry to the next checkpoint!

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:27.530
We're hot on the enemy's heels!

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:36.200
How far was it to your house again, Koharu?

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:39.010
Well, you've been there before, haven't you?

00:06:39.010 --> 00:06:40.960
This is what happens when you don't pace yourself.

00:06:44.190 --> 00:06:46.630
Oh, heavenly maiden!

00:06:54.010 --> 00:06:55.470
It's all that thing's fault!

00:06:55.470 --> 00:06:57.890
My lifeforce is being drained away!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:02.300
It's got to be some...
mysterious, invisible power!

00:07:02.860 --> 00:07:05.250
Sounds like you still have energy to spare.

00:07:05.250 --> 00:07:06.290
My point is...

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.650
It's not my fault!

00:07:09.170 --> 00:07:11.280
I'm blaming that Disc for everything!

00:07:13.020 --> 00:07:14.460
Right.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:15.560
Um...

00:07:16.320 --> 00:07:17.410
Could I talk to you?

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:25.360
Togawa-san...

00:07:26.910 --> 00:07:28.050
Shione-san!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:33.730
I heard you the first time.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:34.730
Oh, good.

00:07:35.390 --> 00:07:36.140
What?

00:07:36.140 --> 00:07:37.330
Do you need something?

00:07:37.330 --> 00:07:40.090
U-Um, not exactly...

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:43.910
It's just that, um, I haven't really had
the chance to talk with you yet, and...

00:07:47.790 --> 00:07:50.040
When we met here for the first time,

00:07:50.040 --> 00:07:52.030
why did you say what you did?

00:07:53.130 --> 00:07:55.270
<i>Why did you come back
here after all this time?</i>

00:07:58.900 --> 00:07:59.930
How irritating.

00:07:59.930 --> 00:08:02.000
U-Um, Shione-san!

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:05.000
If you call out to me again
like we're actually friends,

00:08:05.000 --> 00:08:05.620
Huh?

00:08:06.230 --> 00:08:07.330
If you ever do it again...

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:09.650
Wh-What?

00:08:11.300 --> 00:08:12.680
I'll slap you.

00:08:16.870 --> 00:08:17.970
Why?

00:08:18.950 --> 00:08:20.160
Are you all right?

00:08:21.400 --> 00:08:22.080
Yeah.

00:08:22.920 --> 00:08:25.480
You shouldn't blame yourself.

00:08:25.480 --> 00:08:26.440
Shione...

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.820
She was never very friendly towards other people.

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.400
She's changed a lot from when she was little.

00:08:34.080 --> 00:08:35.880
Have you known her for a long time?

00:08:35.880 --> 00:08:39.520
Yes. Shione grew up in this town, too.

00:08:40.620 --> 00:08:44.290
Come on guys! What's the holdup?

00:08:45.010 --> 00:08:46.180
All right then...

00:08:46.180 --> 00:08:49.790
I'm not going to accept being shunned for no reason.

00:08:51.350 --> 00:08:54.530
Koharu, thanks for looking out for me.

00:08:54.530 --> 00:08:58.170
I think I still want to be Shione-san's friend,

00:08:58.170 --> 00:09:00.350
so I'll go talk to her again.

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:04.100
Sure. Good luck.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:28.370
Um, Togawa-san.

00:09:30.290 --> 00:09:33.380
I heard that you've lived here since you were young.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:37.870
The truth is I used to live here too.

00:09:39.530 --> 00:09:43.010
Well, I was really little,
so I don't remember much about it.

00:09:45.450 --> 00:09:46.820
So I was right.

00:09:46.820 --> 00:09:47.490
Huh?

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:50.970
Shione... san?

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.130
Nonoka.

00:09:55.130 --> 00:09:56.530
Y-Yes?

00:09:56.530 --> 00:09:57.650
You're annoying.

00:09:57.650 --> 00:09:58.780
Go away.

00:09:58.780 --> 00:10:00.530
I don't want to see you ever again.

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.350
Also, remember what I said?

00:10:08.460 --> 00:10:10.540
Wh-What happened?

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.210
It's nothing.

00:10:13.210 --> 00:10:14.960
Don't worry about it.

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:22.650
If you say so...

00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:28.400
We're finally here!

00:10:29.130 --> 00:10:31.810
I'll go and let the teacher know.

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.860
Oh, sure.

00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:34.900
Thanks!

00:10:36.410 --> 00:10:37.330
Sensei!

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:39.030
Quickly! Stamp us off!

00:10:46.150 --> 00:10:47.050
Noel?

00:10:47.680 --> 00:10:48.740
What are you doing?

00:10:48.740 --> 00:10:50.120
Nonoka!

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:56.150
Noel!

00:10:56.710 --> 00:10:57.360
Oh dear.

00:10:57.360 --> 00:10:58.460
Noel!

00:11:02.730 --> 00:11:05.470
Mr. Monster, I'm so sorry!

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.820
Noel, are you hurt?

00:11:11.930 --> 00:11:13.800
Here, wipe your face.

00:11:13.800 --> 00:11:15.150
Nonoka!

00:11:16.740 --> 00:11:17.920
Noel...

00:11:17.920 --> 00:11:20.710
Nonoka, you're done with school already?

00:11:20.710 --> 00:11:23.530
No, we're having extracurricular activities.

00:11:23.850 --> 00:11:26.030
Ex... tra?

00:11:26.580 --> 00:11:29.160
It means I'm still in school. Sorry.

00:11:30.120 --> 00:11:31.600
Okay...

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:34.270
You're so cute!

00:11:34.270 --> 00:11:35.900
Who's this?

00:11:35.900 --> 00:11:37.170
Your little sister?

00:11:37.170 --> 00:11:38.800
Would you mind if I kidnapped her?

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:41.060
I've mentioned her before, haven't I?

00:11:41.700 --> 00:11:43.050
This is Noel.

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:45.200
Good to meet'cha!

00:11:52.740 --> 00:11:54.170
Noel!

00:11:56.430 --> 00:11:57.900
Nice to meet you.

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.220
Who's that?

00:12:09.830 --> 00:12:13.910
Shione, we're moving to the next checkpoint.

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:21.270
What?

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:24.780
Why are you being so cold to Nonoka?

00:12:24.780 --> 00:12:26.460
Because I don't like her.

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:27.660
That's all there is to it.

00:12:29.390 --> 00:12:30.890
You haven't figured it out yet?

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.480
I don't blame you.

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:36.310
No one would expect her
to come back, now of all times.

00:12:36.740 --> 00:12:37.600
Eh?

00:12:39.270 --> 00:12:40.360
Enemy sighted!

00:12:40.860 --> 00:12:42.710
Don't think you're too far ahead!

00:12:42.710 --> 00:12:45.330
We're a team of five now!

00:12:46.530 --> 00:12:47.910
Why'd they get another member?

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:49.370
Dunno.

00:12:50.240 --> 00:12:51.480
Come, Noel.

00:12:51.480 --> 00:12:54.060
We'll show you what we're made of!

00:12:57.820 --> 00:12:59.940
What do you mean?

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:04.120
I'm saying that she's mocking us.

00:13:06.310 --> 00:13:09.470
Hurry up! Hurry up! Hurry up!

00:13:17.100 --> 00:13:20.530
Our next checkpoint is on the
other side of those mountains.

00:13:26.620 --> 00:13:28.240
Is the next one our last stop?

00:13:28.630 --> 00:13:30.430
Yup, it should be.

00:13:30.430 --> 00:13:32.120
There's still a bit to go, though.

00:13:34.360 --> 00:13:36.870
Noel, aren't you tired?

00:13:37.470 --> 00:13:39.460
Noel's not tired!

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:44.040
You look the most exhausted to me, Yuzuki.

00:13:44.040 --> 00:13:46.050
I'm not tired at all!

00:13:46.050 --> 00:13:48.130
Huh? Where's Togawa-san?

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:52.010
She was walking behind us not too long ago...

00:13:53.610 --> 00:13:57.230
Maybe she got lost somewhere back there?

00:13:58.180 --> 00:14:00.970
She's probably just lagging behind.

00:14:00.970 --> 00:14:02.500
I'm gonna go look for her!

00:14:02.500 --> 00:14:03.130
Huh?

00:14:03.130 --> 00:14:04.200
I'll catch up to you guys!

00:14:04.200 --> 00:14:05.280
Nonoka?

00:14:05.940 --> 00:14:07.760
Shouldn't we all go?

00:14:07.760 --> 00:14:08.810
Nonoka!

00:14:08.810 --> 00:14:10.160
Noel will come too!

00:14:10.160 --> 00:14:12.290
It's fine! I'll be back soon!

00:14:12.290 --> 00:14:13.800
Wait there with everyone else!

00:14:15.990 --> 00:14:19.520
Yuzuki! Look after Noel for me!

00:14:19.520 --> 00:14:21.290
R-Right, got it!

00:14:26.050 --> 00:14:28.340
Is Nonoka going to be all right?

00:14:28.340 --> 00:14:30.140
She's been gone for a while.

00:14:33.070 --> 00:14:34.180
What are you doing?

00:14:37.700 --> 00:14:39.010
Shione!

00:14:39.010 --> 00:14:40.350
Where's Nonoka?

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:42.970
No idea.

00:14:42.970 --> 00:14:45.610
Wait, how did you get in front of us?

00:14:46.230 --> 00:14:48.930
Did she make a wrong turn somewhere?

00:14:48.930 --> 00:14:50.080
I guess so.

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:51.670
Nonoka!

00:14:51.670 --> 00:14:52.620
Noel, wait!

00:14:53.150 --> 00:14:54.200
Noel-chan?

00:14:58.760 --> 00:15:10.110
Togawa-san!

00:15:18.450 --> 00:15:20.490
I think I got lost instead...

00:15:22.770 --> 00:15:24.430
Noel!

00:15:24.430 --> 00:15:25.930
Nonoka!

00:15:27.130 --> 00:15:29.170
Noel!

00:15:29.170 --> 00:15:30.710
Nonoka!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:37.040
Yuzuki?

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:38.510
Souta-kun...

00:15:38.510 --> 00:15:39.770
What?

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:42.020
We were done ages ago.

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.250
Right.

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:46.800
Koharu, we're in charge of
watching out for the stragglers.

00:15:47.330 --> 00:15:50.440
Where's the new girl and the little kid?

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:53.050
Well...

00:16:33.340 --> 00:16:36.250
I wonder if they found Shione-san...

00:16:39.210 --> 00:16:40.800
I can't seem to do anything right.

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:49.910
Komiya!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:52.190
Nonoka!

00:16:53.700 --> 00:16:56.770
Still, it's been a while since
we were all together like this.

00:16:56.770 --> 00:16:57.700
Huh?

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:00.120
Oh, yeah, you're right.

00:17:00.120 --> 00:17:03.370
We were all in different classes until last year.

00:17:03.370 --> 00:17:06.150
Well, there's no way they'd let
both twins be in the same class.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.250
It'd be too troublesome to deal with.

00:17:09.730 --> 00:17:11.490
Hey, do you remember?

00:17:11.490 --> 00:17:12.720
Back then, we—

00:17:12.720 --> 00:17:13.460
Stop!

00:17:15.210 --> 00:17:17.620
If she hadn't said that back then...

00:17:18.380 --> 00:17:20.600
That Disc wouldn't be here today?

00:17:21.470 --> 00:17:22.980
Of course not!

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:24.480
And you hate her for it?

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:26.340
Of course I do!

00:17:26.340 --> 00:17:28.320
I hate that girl who called forth the Disc!

00:17:28.320 --> 00:17:31.540
Then why are you friends with her?

00:17:31.540 --> 00:17:32.480
Huh?

00:18:12.610 --> 00:18:13.760
Found you.

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:16.480
That tune...

00:18:17.810 --> 00:18:19.640
I got really good, didn't I?

00:18:22.050 --> 00:18:25.020
You're really...

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:26.910
Seven years ago...

00:18:30.060 --> 00:18:30.670
Hm?

00:18:34.980 --> 00:18:37.800
I wonder how far away Tokyo is...

00:18:39.000 --> 00:18:40.050
There you are!

00:18:40.050 --> 00:18:40.640
Oh?

00:18:41.250 --> 00:18:42.450
What's up?

00:18:42.450 --> 00:18:45.610
She told me to go find you

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:47.510
before it gets eaten...

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:49.030
Someone will eat it?

00:18:49.030 --> 00:18:50.810
Yeah. Hurry!

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:52.290
There's one left, right?

00:18:52.290 --> 00:18:53.820
So why can't I have it?

00:18:54.110 --> 00:18:55.330
No, you can't!

00:18:55.330 --> 00:18:57.240
It's one per person!

00:18:58.820 --> 00:18:59.990
Hey!

00:19:00.430 --> 00:19:01.950
Here, catch!

00:19:05.200 --> 00:19:06.830
Wolf it down, quick!

00:19:08.080 --> 00:19:09.300
Nice!

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:10.890
That's the end of that!

00:19:10.890 --> 00:19:12.570
Aw, come on...

00:19:25.490 --> 00:19:26.090
Huh?

00:19:27.060 --> 00:19:29.230
Um, um...

00:19:34.080 --> 00:19:35.320
Disc-san?

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:38.200
You told me about it before, right?

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:39.880
If you wish with all your friends together,

00:19:39.880 --> 00:19:41.610
a Disc will appear.

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:45.620
Yeah, it was in a book I read.

00:19:46.430 --> 00:19:47.890
Let's try it, together!

00:19:47.890 --> 00:19:48.670
Huh?

00:19:49.640 --> 00:19:52.830
I want to do something... with everyone.

00:19:53.410 --> 00:19:54.380
Why?

00:19:56.250 --> 00:20:01.130
We might not get to see
each other when it's winter...

00:20:03.080 --> 00:20:04.310
You're right!

00:20:04.310 --> 00:20:08.640
It'll be hard for us to meet up here when it's snowing too heavily.

00:20:08.950 --> 00:20:09.420
Huh?

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:13.200
Yeah.

00:20:15.410 --> 00:20:18.610
Then, before that happens...

00:20:19.170 --> 00:20:19.930
Yup!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:25.620
Nonoka's the same girl as back then?

00:20:25.920 --> 00:20:27.880
That can't be true!

00:20:27.880 --> 00:20:29.940
And why not?

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:32.360
Because Nonoka's my friend,

00:20:32.360 --> 00:20:34.840
and she helped me with chasing away the Disc,

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.150
and...

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:37.840
And?

00:20:38.460 --> 00:20:40.000
She used to live here.

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:41.760
Huh?

00:20:42.290 --> 00:20:43.690
She said so herself.

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:45.760
Really?

00:20:46.270 --> 00:20:49.520
She got all of us to help her summon the Disc,

00:20:51.310 --> 00:20:52.770
and just disappeared from this town.

00:20:54.650 --> 00:21:00.060
Unable to tell anyone, we've been silently regretting it these seven years, thinking,

00:21:00.060 --> 00:21:02.280
"why did we do such a thing?"

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:05.680
And then she comes back and becomes your friend?

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:08.030
That says to me that she's here to mock us.

00:21:13.560 --> 00:21:14.980
But...

00:21:14.980 --> 00:21:19.750
But we don't know for sure
whether that was Nonoka or not!

00:21:20.740 --> 00:21:21.990
Yuzuki...

00:21:22.620 --> 00:21:23.240
Hey,

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:24.510
there she is.

00:21:35.140 --> 00:21:36.420
I remember now.

00:21:37.940 --> 00:21:40.440
I was the one who said it to everyone.

00:21:41.450 --> 00:21:43.100
"Let's call it together."

00:21:44.540 --> 00:21:45.530
Yup.

00:21:47.350 --> 00:21:49.690
Nonoka, you called Noel.

00:21:52.590 --> 00:21:53.610
Because...

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:58.030
<i>I'm</i> the Disc.

00:23:31.690 --> 00:23:33.190
Next time, on Sora no Method:

00:23:33.800 --> 00:23:35.020
"Fragments of Memories."

00:23:35.020 --> 00:23:36.440
Look forward to it!
